## Contract Functionality Parity with nouns.camp

### Governance (NounsDAOLogicV3)
| Feature | Status | Contract Function |
|---------|--------|-------------------|
| View proposals | ✅ | Subgraph query |
| Vote FOR/AGAINST/ABSTAIN | ✅ | `castVote()` / `castVoteWithReason()` |
| View vote tallies | ✅ | Subgraph query |
| Proposal state tracking | ✅ | `state()` |
| Create proposal | ✅ | `propose()` |
| Queue proposal | ✅ | `queue()` |
| Execute proposal | ✅ | `execute()` |
| Proposal feedback | ✅ | `sendFeedback()` |

### Candidates (NounsDAOData)
| Feature | Status | Contract Function |
|---------|--------|-------------------|
| Browse candidates | ✅ | Subgraph query |
| Create candidate | ✅ | `createProposalCandidate()` |
| Update candidate | ✅ | `updateProposalCandidate()` |
| Cancel candidate | ✅ | `cancelProposalCandidate()` |
| Sign candidate | ✅ | `addSignature()` |
| Candidate feedback | ✅ | `sendCandidateFeedback()` |

### Auction (NounsAuctionHouse)
| Feature | Status | Contract Function |
|---------|--------|-------------------|
| View current auction | ✅ | `auction()` |
| Place bid | ✅ | `createBid()` |
| Settle auction | ✅ | `settleCurrentAndCreateNewAuction()` |
| Bid history | ✅ | Subgraph/events |

### Token (NounsToken)
| Feature | Status | Contract Function |
|---------|--------|-------------------|
| Balance check | ✅ | `balanceOf()` |
| Vote power | ✅ | `getCurrentVotes()` |
| Delegate | ✅ | `delegate()` |
| View Noun art | ✅ | `tokenURI()` / descriptor |

### Pixel Studio (probe.wtf/dreams parity)
| Feature | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| 32×32 pixel canvas | ✅ | Touch + stylus optimized |
| Nouns color palette | ✅ | Full on-chain palette |
| Pen/Eraser/Fill/Picker | ✅ | All tools |
| Save locally | ✅ | Gallery system |
| Export as SVG | ✅ | Nouns-compatible |
| Export as PNG | ✅ | For sharing |
| RLE encode for on-chain | ✅ | Nouns format |
| Submit as candidate art | ✅ | Via NounsDAOData |

