## Touchscreen Optimizations

The UI is specifically designed for a 480×320 3-inch display:

- **7px pixel grid cells** — precisely tuned for stylus accuracy on 3" screen
- **Large touch targets** — all buttons min 28px height
- **Bottom navigation** — thumb-reachable nav bar
- **Collapsible palette** — toggle color picker to maximize canvas space
- **CRT/scanline effects** — authentic retro feel without hurting usability
- **Press Start 2P + Silkscreen fonts** — pixel-perfect at small sizes

---

## Environment Variables

Create `.env` in project root:
```
VITE_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.infura.io/v3/YOUR_KEY
VITE_SUBGRAPH_URL=https://api.thegraph.com/subgraphs/name/nounsdao/nouns-subgraph
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=YOUR_WC_PROJECT_ID
VITE_CHAIN_ID=1
```

